// The dash's own GATT server, on the air whenever it's on, for one phone:
// the Android Auto app subscribes to the live one and gets the readings
// (live.h) many times a second; during Send log (in the settings) the log
// page writes 'S' to the control characteristic and gets the log as
// notifications of the data one, then 'D' once it has it all. The app
// pulls what's new every minute, the dash going on as it is: 'R' and the
// position its last pull ended at (u32, 0xFFFFFFFF the first time), the
// part as notifications of the data one (ble.c says their header).
PRIMARY_SERVICE, GAP_SERVICE
CHARACTERISTIC, GAP_DEVICE_NAME, READ, "GT86 DASH"

PRIMARY_SERVICE, c0ff8600-4b1e-4c7a-9e2d-5a3f86d0a001
CHARACTERISTIC, c0ff8601-4b1e-4c7a-9e2d-5a3f86d0a001, WRITE | WRITE_WITHOUT_RESPONSE | DYNAMIC,
CHARACTERISTIC, c0ff8602-4b1e-4c7a-9e2d-5a3f86d0a001, NOTIFY,
CHARACTERISTIC, c0ff8603-4b1e-4c7a-9e2d-5a3f86d0a001, NOTIFY,
